# Copy snippets into each service’s `.env` as needed.
# Default ports when running `npm run dev` from repo root (all four at once):

# payments   → http://localhost:4100  (v1 docs: /v1/api-docs, v2: /v2/api-docs)
# preferences → http://localhost:3001 (/api-docs)
# providers  → http://localhost:4000 (/api-docs)
# coupons    → http://localhost:3002 (/api-docs, /metrics)

# DATABASE_URL / MongoDB / Razorpay / Twilio: see each service’s own config or .env.example.
